#: ../../benchmarks.rst:873
msgid "Edge Load Balancing and HAProxy"
msgstr "El balanceo de carga del edge y HAProxy"

#: ../../benchmarks.rst:878
msgid ""
"By the end of this chapter, we should be able to say where the edge load "
"balancer matches HAProxy, where it does not, and which part of the design "
"explains each difference."
msgstr ""
"Al terminar este capítulo, deberíamos poder decir dónde iguala el "
"balanceador de carga del edge a HAProxy, dónde no, y qué parte del diseño "
"explica cada diferencia."

#: ../../benchmarks.rst:880
msgid ""
"We ran Sibuna's edge mode beside HAProxy 3.0.11 on one host over "
"loopback. Two origins had four CPUs, the proxy eight and the load "
"generator four. Both proxies used eight threads and least connections, "
"and both terminated TLS with the same ECDSA certificate. The record is "
"``benchmarks/results/edge-haproxy-2026-11-24.md``. It is one manual run "
"of eight seconds per cell, not a repeated measurement, so we read "
"differences of a few percent as noise."
msgstr ""
"Ejecutamos el modo edge de Sibuna junto a HAProxy 3.0.11 en un host, por "
"loopback. Dos orígenes tenían cuatro CPU, el proxy ocho y el generador de "
"carga cuatro. Ambos proxies usaron ocho hilos y menos conexiones, y ambos "
"terminaron TLS con el mismo certificado ECDSA. El registro es "
"``benchmarks/results/edge-haproxy-2026-11-24.md``. Es una única ejecución "
"manual de ocho segundos por celda, no una medición repetida, así que "
