#: ../../benchmarks.rst:1364
msgid ""
"Before the change Sibuna carried 149,168 HTTPS requests per second with "
"256 connections. It now carries 174,901, and the whole of that work runs "
"on the eight workers: in the measurement of thread groups they used 35.9 "
"CPU seconds and the runtime threads none. Sibuna is ahead of HAProxy over "
"TCP, HTTP and HTTPS, with less CPU, and behind over HTTP/2, which did not "
"change. No request failed in any line."
msgstr ""
"Antes del cambio, Sibuna atendía 149.168 peticiones HTTPS por segundo con "
"256 conexiones. Ahora atiende 174.901, y todo ese trabajo se ejecuta en "
"los ocho workers: en la medición por grupos de hilos usaron 35,9 segundos "
"de CPU y los hilos del runtime ninguno. Sibuna va por delante de HAProxy "
"en TCP, HTTP y HTTPS, con menos CPU, y por detrás en HTTP/2, que no "
"cambió. No falló ninguna petición en ninguna línea."

#: ../../benchmarks.rst:1366
